## Task

You do **not** write the cards — they are already written and will be inserted by the template. You
write only:

- one short opening paragraph for the week;
- a grouping of the cards by topic, each group with one or two sentences that say what the changes
  in it have in common.

Every card must appear in exactly one group. Use the card ids you are given, unchanged. Order the
groups by how many people the changes affect, most first.

Do not repeat the content of the cards, do not add facts that are not in them, and do not write any
figures or dates: those live in the cards.

Answer with JSON matching the schema. No text around it.
